### 16.1 ICS1 Milestones Developmental Timeline

```
ICS1 (Patient- and Family-Centered Communication) — Developmental Continuum

Level 1 ──→ Level 2 ──→ Level 3 ──→ Level 4 ──→ Level 5

L1: Respect/rapport basics
L2: Therapeutic relationship in straightforward encounters
L3: Therapeutic relationship in challenging encounters; identifies complex barriers
L4: Shared decision-making regardless of complexity; mitigates barriers
L5: Coaches others; models barrier mitigation
